  "pages": [
    "<h1><span style=\"font-family: Black Ops One;\">SUBMIT&nbsp; A&nbsp; TEMPLATE</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Have you made a document template that others could use, customize, or learn from? Share it with the community and help make DocuWrite Pro’s template library better for everyone.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Revalia;\"><b>How do I prepare the document?</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><ol><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Create an amazing document!</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Name the document whatever you want! This will be your </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">template title</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Redact all personal information, using placeholders (as </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">[example]</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">) is highly recommended.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">If you are using locally imported fonts, try finding that font on </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Google Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. If found, use that font instead, load it through the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Online Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> section in the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> menu.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Set the editor to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Editing</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> mode and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">zoom</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">100%</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Make sure there are no misspelled words. Use the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Spell Check</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Grammar Check</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp;feature from </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Make sure no offensive words or phrases are in the document, you may use the built-in </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Avoid Offensive Content</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> feature within </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Before exporting disable any </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp;feature and enabled </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Add-on.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Click the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> button, then click </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export Options</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. Afterward, select </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">SCD</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. Make sure that </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Lock All Images</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Global Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> toggles are turned on, and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Image Quality</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> is set to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">100%</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Click </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export SCD.</span></li></ol><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Revalia;\"><b>How do I submit?</b></span></div><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Send an email to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">mohtadiazadmahi902@gmail.com</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp;with the exported </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">SCD</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> file.</span></li></ol><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Revalia\"><b>A little gift for your contribution.</b></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">When your template is approved and added to the community, you’ll receive a </span><font color=\"#e91e63\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Contributor Badge ♥️&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">as a small thank-you for helping DocuWrite Pro grow. Your badge will be automatically linked to the email address you used when submitting your template, so your contribution stays connected to you. It’s our way of recognizing the people who share their creativity, ideas, and time with the community. You'll be given credit for your template.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Revalia;\"><b>Any Questions?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Have a question about contributing, templates, approval, or anything else? Feel free to reach out directly at <font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">mohtadiazadmahi902@gmail.com.</font>&nbsp;We’re always happy to help!</span></div><p></p><p></p><p></p></div><span class=\"fw-field fw-locked\" id=\"fw_66v3brm\" contenteditable=\"false\" title=\"Read-only\" data-fw=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22actionButton%22%2C%22label%22%3A%22Submission%20Email%20Format%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22sem%22%2C%22placeholder%22%3A%22%22%2C%22defaultValue%22%3A%22%22%2C%22options%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22min%22%3A%22%22%2C%22max%22%3A%22%22%2C%22maxLen%22%3A%22%22%2C%22minLen%22%3A%22%22%2C%22allowNumbers%22%3Afalse%2C%22allowUpper%22%3Afalse%2C%22allowLower%22%3Afalse%2C%22allowSpecial%22%3Afalse%2C%22pattern%22%3A%22%22%2C%22format%22%3A%22%22%2C%22action%22%3A%22page%22%2C%22actionValue%22%3A%22%22%2C%22actionPage%22%3A2%2C%22tooltip%22%3A%22%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22underline%22%2C%22textColor%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22labelColor%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22labelBold%22%3Afalse%2C%22labelSize%22%3A%22%22%2C%22answerSize%22%3A%22%22%2C%22noLabel%22%3Afalse%2C%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23f8bbd0%22%2C%22boxBg%22%3A%22%23fce4ec%22%2C%22bold%22%3Afalse%2C%22width%22%3A%22%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22%22%2C%22lines%22%3A4%2C%22tabIndex%22%3A%22%22%2C%22required%22%3Afalse%2C%22readonly%22%3Atrue%2C%22autoFormat%22%3Afalse%2C%22singleUse%22%3Afalse%7D\" style=\"--fw-text: #000000; --fw-label: #000000; --fw-border: #f8bbd0; --fw-box-bg: #fce4ec; position: absolute; left: -0.176758px; top: 622.519px; z-index: 1000; margin: 0px;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fw-action-control\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"--fw-text:#000000;--fw-label:#000000;--fw-border:#f8bbd0;--fw-box-bg:#fce4ec;\">Submission Email Format</button></span>",
    "<h1><span style=\"font-family: Black Ops One;\">Submission&nbsp; Email&nbsp; Format</span></h1><h3><span style=\"font-family: Black Ops One;\">With example data</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-family: Black Ops One;\"><br></span></div><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Example data is highlighted yellow. Change to your credentials.</span></h5><div><br></div><div><hr style=\"border-width: 2px medium medium; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(244, 143, 177); margin: 12px 0px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.27;\" data-hr-color-type=\"solid\" data-hr-line-style=\"solid\"></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">To: mohtadiazadmahi902@gmail.com&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Subject: Template Submission for DocuWrite Pro</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Name: </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Afra Anan Biva</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Application: sceditor</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Title: </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Submit a Template</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Cover Page: </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Page Count: </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Word Count:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">329</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(230, 238, 156);\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"folder\" class=\"img-locked\" style=\"max-width: none; height: 40.4497px; width: 40px; cursor: move; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; position: absolute; left: -0.0507806px; top: 448.75px; z-index: 1000;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Uploaded SCD file</span>"
